{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2015-06", "window": 4, "start_date": 1435017600, "end_date": 1435708799, "month_true_total": 1049, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:53:06 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "16817353", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061371792", "personaname": "d. bosè", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198061371792/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 91, "playtime_forever": 552, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 509, "last_played": 1491009107, "avatar": "0958208f9c6b7946a078e93197fc390029cd063c"}, "language": "english", "review": "its fun if you have friends to play with", "timestamp_created": 1435703512, "timestamp_updated": 1435703512, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.405112534761428833", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16817132", "author": {"steamid": "76561197966373428", "personaname": "Waffles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197966373428/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 77429, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 76826, "last_played": 1453667653, "avatar": "5314cc0fbd1247bcdcc57515da674c646fa87f27"}, "language": "english", "review": "Getting to see this game go from what it was in open beta to what it is now has been a real pleasure. I am absolutely blown away with what the game is now and the features it has, it has the best micro transaction market I have ever seen. Couple things...\n\n1.  I never spent a dime although I wanted to support Digital Extremes however learning to make platinum became its own game for me and I never had a need to buy...\n\n2. Killing things in this game I found to be extremely satisfying\n\n3. There was always something new I wanted to try and experiment with (builds)\n\nWhen I left Warframe I had EVERY frame and EVERY weapon excluding items no longer available such as Excalibur Prime (founders) ect. and participated in all content (endgame raids/pvp)\n\nIn the end at 1200+ hours I uninstalled the game so I would stop playing it", "timestamp_created": 1435702531, "timestamp_updated": 1466992083, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.498489409685134888", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16816165", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095810765", "personaname": "ROFLMFAOLOL", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/StussyBabylon/", "num_games_owned": 137, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 20470, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1382, "last_played": 1623952543, "avatar": "992a05cebcefaa7fe17f71242d25963bc696e124"}, "language": "english", "review": "About 30 minutes in the game when i started warframe, i already bought the $50 Plat package, buying warframe accessories to make my character look high level as possible. Now high level ppl i meet on missions wont think that I'm a noob and needs their help. Because I don't.\n\n10/10\n\nP.S.- I'm level 2", "timestamp_created": 1435698667, "timestamp_updated": 1435698667, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16815486", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165675557", "personaname": "allfiredup", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198165675557/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 267, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 267, "last_played": 1435939111, "avatar": "babde9ea8e314fc57991023e6708e26050312095"}, "language": "english", "review": "nice game", "timestamp_created": 1435696434, "timestamp_updated": 1435696434, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16814146", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043034029", "personaname": "Perma", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043034029/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 13716, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6322, "last_played": 1761463075, "avatar": "cff11a8a03adfec7d1a981aab5dc8731993b389d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its not for everyone.It is a grindfest so if you are not into grinding for stuff then this game is not for you.I personally like this game and can deal with the grind because you are grinding for ingredients to make something you want.The combat is really fun and smooth so the grinding does not feel so boring and pointless.", "timestamp_created": 1435691629, "timestamp_updated": 1511574581, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}